DE_CODE_USE_BEDROCK` / `_VERTEX` / `_FOUNDRY` 等 provider 开关 —— 走代理场景不需要。\n\n**可选（按需）：**\n- `ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_MODEL_OPTION` / `_NAME` / `_DESCRIPTION` / `_SUPPORTED_CAPABILITIES` —— 自定义别名在 `/model` 选择器里可显示并声明能力（`effort`/`thinking`/`adaptive_thinking`/`interleaved_thinking`/`xhigh_effort`/`max_effort`）。\n- `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_1M_CONTEXT=1` —— 禁用 1M 变体。\n\n---\n\n## 5. 功能需求"},"tool_use_id":"call_81bbf64cc0e04db684c73829","tool_response":"The file D:\\development\\code\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\docs\\PRD-别名路由与多环境隔离.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
